  <dashboards>
    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Definitions'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/Storeportfoliomanagement-WIP/Definitions?rev=' id='Definitions' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/Storeportfoliomanagement-WIP' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='600' maxwidth='1200' minheight='600' minwidth='1200' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='97334' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98666' x='667' y='1333'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11' underline='true'>Tabs:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Live stores / Closures</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman'>- Number of live stores at the start of a month vs the number of active/closed stores</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Store daily status</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman'> -  Number of stores in each status for each country</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Leased area / no of contract&apos;s ending</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman'> - The number of contracts ending in the upcoming months and it’s sum of gross leased area. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11' underline='true'>What is Store in Salesforce:</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman'>Stores in Salesforce are used to track any potential property leads and for every lead identified, a ‘Store’ will be created. This store then will be linked to its related opportunities, tasks, contracts.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11' underline='true'>Store Status Definitions:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Property Identification</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman'> - An area of interest has been identified. Local teams are actively looking for properties. Potential properties are added as leads</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Legal and Ops Review</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman'> - On-site visit to the property, an initial assessment is been performed in order to verify compliance from the operations and legal point of view. Document templates and tasks need to be assigned to various stakeholders and connected to the lead.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Contact Negotiation</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman'> - A property is considered suitable and the local team starts negotiating a contract (letter of intent sent, rent and main legal terms agreed). A separate funnel to track contracts needs to be created. When a contract is signed, the property can be moved to the next stage.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Construction</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman'> - Contractors have been identified, engaged and there is a plan to finalize construction with a clear deadline. A go-live date is assigned to the property.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Store</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman'> - set up and inbounding - Construction has been completed and the store is handed over to Ground operations and commercial teams. Store gets prepared for stocking products. Final licenses are requested to municipalities. A separate funnel is required for licenses and permitting.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Dmart Live</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman'> - 1 Successful customer order has been received, fulfilled and delivered. The store is currently available to receive customer orders. </run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='176' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='84000' id='175' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='84000' x='8000' y='8000'>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='97334' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98666' x='667' y='1333'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11' underline='true'>Tabs:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Live stores / Closures</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman'>- Number of live stores at the start of a month vs the number of active/closed stores</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Store daily status</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman'> -  Number of stores in each status for each country</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Leased area / no of contract&apos;s ending</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman'> - The number of contracts ending in the upcoming months and it’s sum of gross leased area. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11' underline='true'>What is Store in Salesforce:</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman'>Stores in Salesforce are used to track any potential property leads and for every lead identified, a ‘Store’ will be created. This store then will be linked to its related opportunities, tasks, contracts.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11' underline='true'>Store Status Definitions:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Property Identification</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman'> - An area of interest has been identified. Local teams are actively looking for properties. Potential properties are added as leads</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Legal and Ops Review</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman'> - On-site visit to the property, an initial assessment is been performed in order to verify compliance from the operations and legal point of view. Document templates and tasks need to be assigned to various stakeholders and connected to the lead.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Contact Negotiation</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman'> - A property is considered suitable and the local team starts negotiating a contract (letter of intent sent, rent and main legal terms agreed). A separate funnel to track contracts needs to be created. When a contract is signed, the property can be moved to the next stage.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Construction</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman'> - Contractors have been identified, engaged and there is a plan to finalize construction with a clear deadline. A go-live date is assigned to the property.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Store</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman'> - set up and inbounding - Construction has been completed and the store is handed over to Ground operations and commercial teams. Store gets prepared for stocking products. Final licenses are requested to municipalities. A separate funnel is required for licenses and permitting.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Dmart Live</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman'> - 1 Successful customer order has been received, fulfilled and delivered. The store is currently available to receive customer orders. </run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
      <simple-id uuid='{BF97F37D-528A-4D2F-8137-E8A75A5B641D}' />
    </dashboard>
